@startuml
title Provider sync and catalog import activity

start
:OPERATOR triggers provider sync or catalog import control;
:Responsible provider service calls its external provider API;
:Store raw provider payloads;
:Normalize provider-specific schema into internal DTOs;
:Upsert provider-local point snapshots;
:Record sync run and point changes;
:Optionally publish provider.points.snapshot_ready event;
:catalog-service imports provider snapshots through internal provider endpoint;
:Detect inserts, updates, unchanged points, stale points, and inactive points;
:Store aggregated normalized catalog points;
:Record catalog import run and changes;
:Publish catalog.points.imported event when configured;
:analytics-service consumes or ingests catalog event;
:Dashboards show freshness from owned tables/projections;
stop

@enduml
